1
00:01:30,566 --> 00:01:31,551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

2
00:01:31,551 --> 00:01:33,560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

3
00:01:35,660 --> 00:01:38,260
=Episode 3=

4
00:01:59,540 --> 00:02:00,020
Your Highness.

5
00:02:01,050 --> 00:02:01,660
Are you all right?

6
00:02:02,460 --> 00:02:03,180
Are you hurt?

7
00:02:08,010 --> 00:02:09,130
What took you so long?

8
00:02:10,220 --> 00:02:10,660
You're right.

9
00:02:11,730 --> 00:02:12,450
I got here too late.

10
00:02:14,610 --> 00:02:15,540
I'll get you out of here now.

11
00:02:19,690 --> 00:02:20,170
You...

12
00:02:21,100 --> 00:02:22,450
You didn't even bring a torch.

13
00:02:23,290 --> 00:02:24,850
You really aren't afraid to die,
are you?

14
00:03:04,890 --> 00:03:06,060
It's so cold.

15
00:03:08,130 --> 00:03:09,940
Aren't we in Lingnan?

16
00:03:12,290 --> 00:03:13,450
You've lost too much blood.

17
00:03:14,980 --> 00:03:15,660
Hang in there a little longer.

18
00:03:16,610 --> 00:03:17,450
Yan Shang.

19
00:03:18,500 --> 00:03:19,890
I never thought

20
00:03:21,130 --> 00:03:22,450
you'd find me.

21
00:03:22,690 --> 00:03:23,450
Actually,

22
00:03:24,940 --> 00:03:26,220
I never thought

23
00:03:27,380 --> 00:03:29,780
anyone would find me.

24
00:03:31,060 --> 00:03:31,730
You're a princess.

25
00:03:32,130 --> 00:03:32,850
You're of high status.

26
00:03:33,780 --> 00:03:34,450
If you're ever in danger,

27
00:03:35,060 --> 00:03:36,260
everyone will come looking for you.

28
00:03:36,780 --> 00:03:37,890
You're lying.

29
00:03:39,170 --> 00:03:40,060
I've always...

30
00:03:41,060 --> 00:03:41,890
always...

31
00:03:44,010 --> 00:03:45,450
been alone.

32
00:03:47,010 --> 00:03:47,730
No matter

33
00:03:49,130 --> 00:03:50,380
how much danger I was in,

34
00:03:51,980 --> 00:03:54,060
no matter how hard things got,

35
00:03:56,010 --> 00:03:56,940
there was never

36
00:03:58,540 --> 00:04:00,940
anyone there to help me.

37
00:04:04,060 --> 00:04:05,500
No one ever asked

38
00:04:06,500 --> 00:04:07,340
if I was all right,

39
00:04:08,850 --> 00:04:10,940
or if I was hurt.

40
00:04:13,340 --> 00:04:14,010
It's going to be okay.

41
00:04:17,610 --> 00:04:18,780
I'm so cold.

42
00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:28,590
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

43
00:04:31,160 --> 00:04:36,350
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

44
00:04:37,080 --> 00:04:38,480
♪Even when we're covered in mud♪

45
00:04:41,140 --> 00:04:42,170
Yan Shang.

46
00:04:44,410 --> 00:04:46,019
You're so warm.

47
00:04:46,061 --> 00:04:47,550
♪Together we'll plunge into karmic fire♪

48
00:04:47,600 --> 00:04:49,380
♪Burning bright as a song♪

49
00:04:50,700 --> 00:04:51,290
Don't fall asleep.

50
00:04:51,900 --> 00:04:52,540
Let's talk.

51
00:04:53,440 --> 00:04:56,760
♪Be the promise I hold deep in my heart♪

52
00:04:56,900 --> 00:04:57,460
No.

53
00:04:58,100 --> 00:05:00,250
Hardly a word you say is true.

54
00:05:01,980 --> 00:05:02,780
No lies this time.

55
00:05:03,580 --> 00:05:04,410
Ask me anything.

56
00:05:07,170 --> 00:05:08,100
Yan Shang.

57
00:05:09,660 --> 00:05:10,410
Which character

58
00:05:11,780 --> 00:05:13,780
is "Shang" in your name?

59
00:05:15,220 --> 00:05:15,930
Shang, as in "Shangshu".

60
00:05:17,020 --> 00:05:17,900
My father gave me that name.

61
00:05:18,610 --> 00:05:20,810
Why that character?

62
00:05:21,730 --> 00:05:23,370
"I revere the legacy of former worthies,

63
00:05:23,900 --> 00:05:25,050
I grieve that I was born too late
to meet them."

64
00:05:25,930 --> 00:05:26,810
It means to admire.

65
00:05:27,700 --> 00:05:28,979
And also to protect.

66
00:05:29,021 --> 00:05:31,880
♪No panic, fear, hate, or pain.
Smoke fades, leaves fall, flowers bloom♪

67
00:05:31,880 --> 00:05:34,220
♪You're the only one I need♪

68
00:05:35,140 --> 00:05:36,170
That's great.

69
00:05:40,140 --> 00:05:41,660
My name is Wanyao.

70
00:05:41,760 --> 00:05:43,480
♪Be my one and only in this world♪

71
00:05:43,530 --> 00:05:44,730
♪Be my one and only in this life♪

72
00:05:44,780 --> 00:05:47,660
My father gave me this name too.

73
00:05:52,460 --> 00:05:54,850
The sun is setting,
and the road is long.

74
00:05:56,140 --> 00:05:57,250
Tossed about by wind and rain.

75
00:05:59,050 --> 00:06:00,100
That's what my name means.

76
00:06:04,400 --> 00:06:08,630
♪Let me be the fireflies dancing
across your brow♪

77
00:06:11,120 --> 00:06:16,110
♪Let me hold you
whenever the rain falls♪

78
00:06:16,500 --> 00:06:18,740
♪Together we'll soar to the skies♪

79
00:06:18,790 --> 00:06:20,870
♪Together we'll turn to ashes♪

80
00:06:20,920 --> 00:06:22,569
♪Burning bright as a song♪

81
00:06:22,611 --> 00:06:26,060
♪Two shadows entwined,
a beautiful sight♪

82
00:06:26,410 --> 00:06:31,510
♪Be the promise I hold deep in my heart♪

83
00:06:31,510 --> 00:06:33,560
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

84
00:06:34,410 --> 00:06:34,850
Your Highness!

85
00:06:36,660 --> 00:06:37,050
Your Highness!

86
00:06:37,490 --> 00:06:37,900
I'm sorry!

87
00:06:38,220 --> 00:06:38,700
Are you all right?

88
00:06:41,810 --> 00:06:43,170
You're utterly useless.

89
00:06:44,930 --> 00:06:45,490
The rain's too heavy.

90
00:06:45,930 --> 00:06:46,980
We need to find shelter.

91
00:06:48,140 --> 00:06:48,610
I'll carry you.

92
00:06:49,510 --> 00:06:53,150
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

93
00:06:53,260 --> 00:06:59,830
♪If we're lucky to stay in this world,
let's return to when we first met♪

94
00:07:02,120 --> 00:07:07,720
(My lady! My lady!)

95
00:07:08,040 --> 00:07:10,400
♪No matter how fiercely the winds
may cut♪

96
00:07:10,720 --> 00:07:12,320
(My lady! My lady!)

97
00:07:12,960 --> 00:07:15,400
(My lady! My lady!)

98
00:07:16,400 --> 00:07:17,950
♪Be my one and only in this world;
be my one and only in this life♪

99
00:07:18,020 --> 00:07:21,540
(My lady! My lady! My lady!)

100
00:08:01,170 --> 00:08:01,810
You're hurt.

101
00:08:02,580 --> 00:08:03,580
I need to remove the bandage

102
00:08:04,100 --> 00:08:04,900
and check your wound.

103
00:08:07,140 --> 00:08:07,730
Go ahead.

104
00:08:08,660 --> 00:08:09,340
You have my permission.

105
00:08:32,010 --> 00:08:32,820
This wound...

106
00:08:35,370 --> 00:08:36,180
I cut it myself.

107
00:08:36,580 --> 00:08:37,370
I did it to let some blood out.

108
00:08:37,610 --> 00:08:38,370
You were bitten by a snake?

109
00:08:42,820 --> 00:08:44,130
Am I going to die?

110
00:08:45,370 --> 00:08:46,130
If I die...

111
00:08:46,890 --> 00:08:48,180
Then could I be reunited with them

112
00:08:49,100 --> 00:08:50,890
in the underworld?

113
00:08:54,180 --> 00:08:55,250
Today,

114
00:08:56,530 --> 00:08:57,700
I saw her.

115
00:08:58,340 --> 00:08:59,300
When was that?

116
00:09:00,700 --> 00:09:01,730
When I was little.

117
00:09:05,340 --> 00:09:06,060
I meant,

118
00:09:06,610 --> 00:09:07,530
when did the snake bite you?

119
00:09:11,530 --> 00:09:12,730
More than half a day ago.

120
00:09:16,730 --> 00:09:17,730
You've survived this long.

121
00:09:18,770 --> 00:09:19,610
You should be all right.

122
00:09:22,340 --> 00:09:23,010
I see.

123
00:09:52,850 --> 00:09:53,650
I need to examine you further.

124
00:09:54,420 --> 00:09:54,940
Forgive me.

125
00:11:09,820 --> 00:11:10,730
Get some rest.

126
00:11:11,700 --> 00:11:12,580
I'll stay here and watch over you.

127
00:11:31,010 --> 00:11:31,890
(She's running a fever.)

128
00:11:54,250 --> 00:11:54,580
Don't...

129
00:11:55,010 --> 00:11:55,460
Don't...

130
00:11:56,180 --> 00:11:56,940
Don't kill me!

131
00:11:57,650 --> 00:11:58,250
Don't kill me!

132
00:12:07,730 --> 00:12:08,370
Don't kill me!

133
00:12:08,980 --> 00:12:09,770
Don't kill me!

134
00:12:12,340 --> 00:12:12,770
What's wrong?

135
00:12:13,460 --> 00:12:14,130
Don't kill me!

136
00:12:14,850 --> 00:12:15,399
Don't kill me!

137
00:12:15,441 --> 00:12:15,850
Your Highness!

138
00:12:16,580 --> 00:12:18,180
We're safe in the cave. Don't be afraid.

139
00:12:18,850 --> 00:12:19,890
I'll kill you all!

140
00:12:20,420 --> 00:12:21,460
I'll kill you all!

141
00:12:25,250 --> 00:12:26,130
I'll kill you all!

142
00:12:26,610 --> 00:12:26,980
Don't be afraid.

143
00:12:27,220 --> 00:12:27,610
It's all right.

144
00:12:31,730 --> 00:12:32,370
You're safe.

145
00:12:53,980 --> 00:12:54,370
Your Highness.

146
00:12:54,820 --> 00:12:55,460
Don't listen to the thunder.

147
00:12:55,850 --> 00:12:56,650
Just listen to my voice.

148
00:12:59,010 --> 00:12:59,820
This is Lingnan.

149
00:13:00,610 --> 00:13:01,940
Violent storms never last long.

150
00:13:02,820 --> 00:13:03,820
Once we weather the storm, it will pass.

151
00:13:06,580 --> 00:13:07,010
It's all right.

152
00:13:08,060 --> 00:13:08,530
It's all right.

153
00:13:09,700 --> 00:13:10,060
It's okay.

154
00:13:25,420 --> 00:13:25,980
It's okay.

155
00:14:32,220 --> 00:14:33,100
(My lady!)

156
00:14:33,730 --> 00:14:36,679
(My lady! My lady!)

157
00:14:36,721 --> 00:14:37,370
(Search carefully!)

158
00:14:40,180 --> 00:14:44,460
(My lady! My lady!)

159
00:14:49,180 --> 00:14:50,250
Her fever's gone down.

160
00:14:50,940 --> 00:14:51,850
(My lady!)

161
00:14:51,980 --> 00:14:53,060
(My lady!)

162
00:14:54,180 --> 00:14:54,890
(Everyone, search carefully!)

163
00:14:55,370 --> 00:14:56,229
(My lady!)

164
00:14:56,271 --> 00:14:56,749
(Search carefully!)

165
00:14:56,791 --> 00:14:57,439
(No sign of her here!)

166
00:14:57,481 --> 00:14:59,399
(My lady! My lady!)

167
00:14:59,441 --> 00:14:59,989
(No sign of her here!)

168
00:15:00,031 --> 00:15:03,869
(My lady! My lady!)

169
00:15:03,911 --> 00:15:04,530
(Have you checked over here?)

170
00:15:06,610 --> 00:15:07,749
(My lady! My lady!)

171
00:15:07,791 --> 00:15:08,980
(Check over there! Hurry!)

172
00:15:09,370 --> 00:15:11,439
(My lady! Is anyone there?)

173
00:15:11,481 --> 00:15:14,010
(My lady! My lady!)

174
00:15:14,100 --> 00:15:15,180
(My lady! Where are you?)

175
00:15:15,530 --> 00:15:15,989
(My lady!)

176
00:15:16,031 --> 00:15:17,010
(Have you searched this area?)

177
00:15:17,770 --> 00:15:18,460
(My lady!)

178
00:15:20,010 --> 00:15:21,180
(My lady!)

179
00:15:21,460 --> 00:15:22,319
(Check behind that tree!)

180
00:15:22,361 --> 00:15:23,300
(Try over there too!)

181
00:15:23,460 --> 00:15:23,890
(Got it!)

182
00:15:24,340 --> 00:15:30,199
(My lady! My lady!)

183
00:15:30,241 --> 00:15:31,100
(Has anyone checked over there?)

184
00:15:31,220 --> 00:15:31,829
(My lady!)

185
00:15:31,871 --> 00:15:33,439
(She couldn't have gone far!
She must be nearby!)

186
00:15:33,481 --> 00:15:34,610
(My lady!)

187
00:15:34,980 --> 00:15:37,010
(My lady! My lady!)

188
00:15:37,100 --> 00:15:38,980
(There's a path here! This way!)

189
00:15:39,300 --> 00:15:40,559
(My lady! My lady!)

190
00:15:40,601 --> 00:15:41,199
(Anyone there?)

191
00:15:41,241 --> 00:15:43,399
(My lady! My lady!)

192
00:15:43,441 --> 00:15:43,940
(Check over there!)

193
00:15:44,980 --> 00:15:46,060
(My lady!)

194
00:15:47,060 --> 00:15:51,820
(My lady! My lady!)

195
00:15:52,180 --> 00:15:52,850
(What about over here?)

196
00:15:53,340 --> 00:15:54,300
(My lady! No sign of her here!)

197
00:15:55,730 --> 00:15:56,490
(Let's search farther ahead!)

198
00:15:56,770 --> 00:15:59,300
(My lady! My lady!)

199
00:16:00,250 --> 00:16:06,340
(My lady! My lady!)

200
00:16:26,700 --> 00:16:27,130
Your Highness.

201
00:16:28,370 --> 00:16:29,300
The storm has passed.

202
00:16:35,460 --> 00:16:36,130
Shang's back!

203
00:16:36,820 --> 00:16:37,799
Why are you carrying someone?

204
00:16:37,841 --> 00:16:39,180
Brother, what happened?

205
00:16:39,370 --> 00:16:41,250
Xiaozhou, quick! Get your medical kit!

206
00:16:49,890 --> 00:16:51,220
Sleeping in your bed

207
00:16:52,370 --> 00:16:54,580
is much more comfortable
than lying in the woods.

208
00:17:08,980 --> 00:17:10,810
Brother, are you sure I can do this?

209
00:17:11,250 --> 00:17:13,460
I've only treated injured cows
and sheep for the villagers.

210
00:17:15,290 --> 00:17:16,530
And one dog.

211
00:17:17,220 --> 00:17:18,090
It was bitten by a leopard.

212
00:17:18,620 --> 00:17:20,380
Stopping bleeding and dressing wounds
work the same on people and animals.

213
00:17:21,140 --> 00:17:22,220
Everyone says you did a good job.

214
00:17:23,250 --> 00:17:24,010
Treat her wounds for now.

215
00:17:24,460 --> 00:17:25,530
I'll go into town for a physician

216
00:17:26,090 --> 00:17:27,250
and tell the authorities
we've found her.

217
00:17:28,090 --> 00:17:29,730
There's no need to fetch
a physician from town.

218
00:17:30,330 --> 00:17:31,050
I'm not going to die.

219
00:17:32,660 --> 00:17:34,250
If you dare bring the authorities
here again,

220
00:17:35,490 --> 00:17:36,770
I'll tear your house down!

221
00:17:37,570 --> 00:17:38,980
Xiaozhou, you handle this instead.

222
00:17:49,420 --> 00:17:50,860
My lady, you have quite a few wounds,

223
00:17:51,090 --> 00:17:52,220
but luckily, they're all superficial.

224
00:17:52,730 --> 00:17:53,620
With some ointment

225
00:17:53,700 --> 00:17:54,660
and a few doses of herbal medicine,

226
00:17:54,980 --> 00:17:55,810
you should recover.

227
00:18:10,530 --> 00:18:11,220
You've got the wrong hand.

228
00:18:11,380 --> 00:18:12,140
That's my hand.

229
00:18:13,010 --> 00:18:13,900
Exactly.

230
00:18:14,900 --> 00:18:15,530
Yan Shang.

231
00:18:16,770 --> 00:18:17,570
What are you doing?

232
00:18:22,460 --> 00:18:23,010
It's my fault.

233
00:18:29,250 --> 00:18:29,980
Don't you dare leave.

234
00:18:39,220 --> 00:18:39,660
I'm not leaving.

235
00:18:43,140 --> 00:18:43,570
Brother.

236
00:18:44,090 --> 00:18:45,119
My lady's still very weak.

237
00:18:45,161 --> 00:18:45,900
Stay with her for a while.

238
00:18:46,140 --> 00:18:46,660
I'll go brew the medicine.

239
00:18:47,380 --> 00:18:47,700
All right.

240
00:18:50,180 --> 00:18:51,010
Fang Tong and the others

241
00:18:52,220 --> 00:18:53,140
must still be looking for me.

242
00:18:54,140 --> 00:18:55,290
Let them know I'm here.

243
00:18:56,010 --> 00:18:56,330
Okay.

244
00:19:33,700 --> 00:19:34,620
I have no excuse, my lady!

245
00:19:34,700 --> 00:19:36,050
I failed to keep you safe!

246
00:19:36,570 --> 00:19:37,380
I thought...

247
00:19:38,090 --> 00:19:38,730
I thought...

248
00:19:38,860 --> 00:19:39,660
You thought

249
00:19:40,050 --> 00:19:41,380
I'd be left dead in the wilderness?

250
00:19:44,810 --> 00:19:45,490
Where's Chunhua?

251
00:19:46,050 --> 00:19:47,090
Why didn't she come back with you?

252
00:19:47,460 --> 00:19:48,460
Don't worry, my lady.

253
00:19:48,730 --> 00:19:49,490
Once she gets word,

254
00:19:49,770 --> 00:19:50,940
she'll come find us.

255
00:19:53,010 --> 00:19:53,730
Fang Tong.

256
00:19:54,490 --> 00:19:55,620
Has anyone ever told you

257
00:19:56,290 --> 00:19:57,860
you sound awful when you cry?

258
00:20:00,290 --> 00:20:00,810
Stop blubbering.

259
00:20:01,490 --> 00:20:02,180
Go get Yan Shang.

260
00:20:07,220 --> 00:20:07,810
I want to bathe.

261
00:20:08,810 --> 00:20:10,180
Your wounds haven't scabbed over yet.

262
00:20:10,380 --> 00:20:11,050
You can't soak them in water.

263
00:20:11,660 --> 00:20:12,460
You'll have to bear with it.

264
00:20:12,900 --> 00:20:14,140
Who said anything about soaking?

265
00:20:15,010 --> 00:20:16,010
I'm covered from head to toe

266
00:20:16,330 --> 00:20:18,090
in blood, sweat, and mud.

267
00:20:18,810 --> 00:20:19,900
I couldn't be any filthier.

268
00:20:20,220 --> 00:20:21,290
At least let me wash myself off.

269
00:20:21,860 --> 00:20:22,700
Go heat some water.

270
00:20:28,700 --> 00:20:30,460
My lady!

271
00:20:30,770 --> 00:20:32,530
What a terrible way to die!

272
00:20:33,250 --> 00:20:35,220
My lady!

273
00:20:37,220 --> 00:20:39,090
My lady!

274
00:20:39,570 --> 00:20:41,490
What a terrible way to die!

275
00:20:42,490 --> 00:20:45,220
How could you leave me all alone?

276
00:20:46,620 --> 00:20:50,660
Where am I supposed to go without you,
my lady?

277
00:20:51,570 --> 00:20:53,620
Please don't abandon me!

278
00:20:54,250 --> 00:20:55,900
My lady!

279
00:21:10,380 --> 00:21:11,220
What are you laughing at?

280
00:21:14,490 --> 00:21:15,330
Forgive me, miss.

281
00:21:16,290 --> 00:21:17,420
I didn't mean to laugh.

282
00:21:17,700 --> 00:21:18,180
It's just...

283
00:21:18,730 --> 00:21:19,490
Just what?

284
00:21:20,010 --> 00:21:20,420
It's just...

285
00:21:21,380 --> 00:21:22,220
There's something on your face...

286
00:21:26,330 --> 00:21:28,250
Are you scattering spirit money?

287
00:21:28,980 --> 00:21:30,140
Has an elder or relative passed away?

288
00:21:36,900 --> 00:21:37,860
Oh, please don't cry!

289
00:21:38,330 --> 00:21:39,010
I'm sorry.

290
00:21:39,490 --> 00:21:41,180
I shouldn't have brought up something
so painful.

291
00:21:42,660 --> 00:21:43,620
Not an elder.

292
00:21:44,530 --> 00:21:45,700
Nor a relative.

293
00:21:47,090 --> 00:21:49,090
It was my lady.

294
00:21:54,490 --> 00:21:55,050
Here, take this.

295
00:22:13,050 --> 00:22:15,570
My lady was still so young.

296
00:22:17,730 --> 00:22:19,090
She was such a good person.

297
00:22:19,620 --> 00:22:21,090
She'd already suffered so much.

298
00:22:21,770 --> 00:22:22,530
I never thought

299
00:22:23,730 --> 00:22:25,420
she'd lose her life like this.

300
00:22:26,980 --> 00:22:27,380
My condolences.

301
00:22:27,770 --> 00:22:28,180
My condolences.

302
00:22:29,010 --> 00:22:30,660
The others are still looking for her.

303
00:22:31,090 --> 00:22:33,050
I... I don't dare tell them.

304
00:22:34,140 --> 00:22:35,900
But if I send her spirit money too late,

305
00:22:36,220 --> 00:22:38,220
she'll have nothing for her journey.

306
00:22:38,900 --> 00:22:41,069
I can't let her arrive in the underworld

307
00:22:41,111 --> 00:22:42,490
without a penny to her name!

308
00:22:44,700 --> 00:22:46,140
My lady!

309
00:22:46,940 --> 00:22:48,570
Here's your money!

310
00:22:49,570 --> 00:22:52,140
Did you get it?

311
00:22:56,460 --> 00:22:57,330
Don't despair just yet.

312
00:22:57,940 --> 00:22:59,380
Your lady might still be alive.

313
00:23:00,220 --> 00:23:01,490
She might've jumped out
of the carriage herself.

314
00:23:05,330 --> 00:23:07,050
She fell from such a great height!

315
00:23:07,220 --> 00:23:08,660
And my lady can't even swim!

316
00:23:08,730 --> 00:23:10,250
How could she possibly have gotten away
on her own?

317
00:23:10,810 --> 00:23:11,140
Well...

318
00:23:13,140 --> 00:23:13,420
Then...

319
00:23:17,290 --> 00:23:18,460
I don't want to talk to you anymore!

320
00:23:18,730 --> 00:23:19,490
Where are you going?

321
00:23:19,770 --> 00:23:20,730
There's no path through those woods.

322
00:23:20,980 --> 00:23:21,860
I don't know you!

323
00:24:20,220 --> 00:24:20,660
Your Highness.

324
00:24:21,250 --> 00:24:21,860
The water's ready.

325
00:24:22,570 --> 00:24:23,900
I... I'll go get Xiaozhou.

326
00:24:24,140 --> 00:24:25,250
What do you need her for?

327
00:24:29,290 --> 00:24:30,290
Could she even carry me?

328
00:24:32,660 --> 00:24:33,730
What are you waiting for?

329
00:24:39,940 --> 00:24:40,620
Carry me over there.

330
00:24:46,250 --> 00:24:46,570
Carry you?

331
00:24:49,810 --> 00:24:50,980
What else?

332
00:24:52,460 --> 00:24:53,250
Do I look

333
00:24:53,460 --> 00:24:55,220
like I'm in any condition to walk?

334
00:25:31,570 --> 00:25:32,010
Stop right there.

335
00:25:40,290 --> 00:25:41,010
If you leave,

336
00:25:42,330 --> 00:25:43,620
who'll wait on me while I bathe?

337
00:26:03,530 --> 00:26:04,900
Miss, you're finally back!

338
00:26:05,980 --> 00:26:06,250
You...

339
00:26:06,980 --> 00:26:07,810
What are you doing here?

340
00:26:09,330 --> 00:26:10,980
That young man you were traveling with?

341
00:26:11,050 --> 00:26:11,810
He's gone back.

342
00:26:12,140 --> 00:26:12,980
He asked me to tell you

343
00:26:13,180 --> 00:26:13,860
to go find him.

344
00:26:14,250 --> 00:26:14,860
He's gone back?

345
00:26:15,980 --> 00:26:16,570
Back where?

346
00:26:16,940 --> 00:26:17,620
He said

347
00:26:18,660 --> 00:26:20,140
he'd gone back to
where he was staying before.

348
00:26:21,250 --> 00:26:22,330
Why would he go back to the Yan house?

349
00:26:24,290 --> 00:26:25,090
Miss! Miss!

350
00:26:25,530 --> 00:26:26,220
Stop following me!

351
00:26:29,490 --> 00:26:30,290
But, miss...

352
00:26:30,460 --> 00:26:31,660
I'm still waiting here.

353
00:26:35,940 --> 00:26:36,980
Miss, why are you back?

354
00:26:58,140 --> 00:26:58,490
Oh, no.

355
00:26:59,570 --> 00:27:00,490
Where was his house again?

356
00:27:02,620 --> 00:27:03,490
Are you lost, miss?

357
00:27:06,940 --> 00:27:07,460
Let me ask you something.

358
00:27:08,220 --> 00:27:10,460
Do you know a family named Yan
who lives in these mountains?

359
00:27:10,980 --> 00:27:12,460
Are you headed to the Yan residence,
my lady?

360
00:27:13,330 --> 00:27:14,090
You know them?

361
00:27:15,570 --> 00:27:16,220
Wonderful!

362
00:27:16,530 --> 00:27:18,140
Then hurry and tell me how to get there.

363
00:27:19,050 --> 00:27:19,940
What a coincidence!

364
00:27:20,180 --> 00:27:21,290
You probably won't believe this,

365
00:27:21,490 --> 00:27:22,420
but I'm headed to their house myself.

366
00:27:22,660 --> 00:27:23,420
We could go together.

367
00:27:34,700 --> 00:27:35,330
I don't believe you.

368
00:27:36,860 --> 00:27:38,010
You wouldn't be a swindler, would you?

369
00:27:39,460 --> 00:27:41,140
Or are you a kidnapper
trying to lure me away?

370
00:27:42,770 --> 00:27:43,090
I...

371
00:27:46,810 --> 00:27:47,620
I'm not a bad person.

372
00:28:00,300 --> 00:28:02,340
(Certificate of Examination Eligibility
Yingxiang 21, Feb. 2; Santu Magistrate)

373
00:28:04,980 --> 00:28:07,090
Certificate of Examination Eligibility.

374
00:28:09,490 --> 00:28:10,050
To tell you the truth, miss,

375
00:28:10,620 --> 00:28:11,420
I've passed the local qualifying exam.

376
00:28:11,770 --> 00:28:13,420
Soon I'll be heading to the capital
for the imperial exams.

377
00:28:13,770 --> 00:28:15,250
This certificate proves
I'm telling the truth.

378
00:28:15,940 --> 00:28:16,660
I'm a friend of Yan Shang's.

379
00:28:16,940 --> 00:28:17,660
I'm going to his house today

380
00:28:17,810 --> 00:28:19,050
to share the good news with him.

381
00:28:19,570 --> 00:28:20,250
You really know Yan...

382
00:28:38,980 --> 00:28:40,380
What's wrong, miss?

383
00:28:41,570 --> 00:28:43,770
I've been searching these mountains
for my lady for two days.

384
00:28:44,660 --> 00:28:45,730
My feet are covered in blood blisters.

385
00:28:50,730 --> 00:28:51,090
How about this?

386
00:28:52,010 --> 00:28:52,810
You can ride my horse.

387
00:28:53,770 --> 00:28:54,530
Then your feet won't hurt.

388
00:28:58,140 --> 00:28:59,570
But I've never ridden a horse before.

389
00:29:00,140 --> 00:29:01,330
Don't worry. I'll lead it for you.

390
00:29:21,330 --> 00:29:21,730
Forgive me.

391
00:29:30,250 --> 00:29:30,940
Hold on tight, miss.

392
00:29:53,220 --> 00:29:53,940
Try a different incense.

393
00:29:54,490 --> 00:29:55,330
I don't like this scent.

394
00:29:56,490 --> 00:29:56,860
Okay.

395
00:30:13,250 --> 00:30:13,810
I've changed it.

396
00:30:21,810 --> 00:30:22,660
The water's getting cold.

397
00:30:23,330 --> 00:30:23,770
Okay.

398
00:30:41,250 --> 00:30:43,180
Careful! Don't scald me.

399
00:30:45,860 --> 00:30:46,220
Of course.

400
00:31:00,330 --> 00:31:00,770
Just right.

401
00:31:06,420 --> 00:31:06,900
The bath powder.

402
00:31:09,090 --> 00:31:09,570
The bath powder.

403
00:31:48,480 --> 00:31:51,950
♪The midsummer breeze blows soft
and sweet♪

404
00:31:52,820 --> 00:31:55,960
♪Fireflies dance freely
through the night♪

405
00:31:57,110 --> 00:32:00,830
♪Chasing the beauty
of this fleeting world♪

406
00:32:01,340 --> 00:32:04,560
♪A thousand lights turn night into day♪

407
00:32:05,440 --> 00:32:08,940
♪Cicada songs mingle with the wine♪

408
00:32:09,850 --> 00:32:12,790
♪Their songs linger
through the passing years♪

409
00:32:14,185 --> 00:32:17,615
♪Life is but a fleeting stay♪

410
00:32:17,930 --> 00:32:21,580
♪How lucky I am to walk this path
with you♪

411
00:32:22,660 --> 00:32:26,050
♪Playing out life's game,
forever by your side♪

412
00:32:27,620 --> 00:32:28,570
What happened?

413
00:32:29,620 --> 00:32:30,180
The wind picked up.

414
00:32:31,220 --> 00:32:34,540
♪I thought time might stand still♪

415
00:32:34,780 --> 00:32:38,720
♪Forever at that crossroads♪

416
00:32:42,180 --> 00:32:43,050
(This is fun!)

417
00:32:43,860 --> 00:32:44,860
(What am I, a tiger?)

418
00:32:45,250 --> 00:32:46,380
(You think I'm going to eat you?)

419
00:32:48,290 --> 00:32:49,050
(You're joking, Your Highness.)

420
00:32:50,570 --> 00:32:53,010
(My name is Mu Wanyao,
not Your Highness.)

421
00:32:53,940 --> 00:32:55,050
(Mu Wanyao?)

422
00:32:55,420 --> 00:32:56,660
(But I'm a princess.)

423
00:32:57,460 --> 00:32:58,530
(How could you address me
by my given name?)

424
00:33:00,250 --> 00:33:00,660
Xiaozhou.

425
00:33:00,980 --> 00:33:02,490
Why don't I go give Shang a hand?

426
00:33:03,980 --> 00:33:05,620
No, no!

427
00:33:06,420 --> 00:33:07,860
Father, let's go back inside.

428
00:33:09,770 --> 00:33:10,050
Come on.

429
00:33:10,490 --> 00:33:10,989
Father!

430
00:33:11,031 --> 00:33:11,490
Dalang!

431
00:33:12,290 --> 00:33:13,460
I've had more than enough of this sun.

432
00:33:13,770 --> 00:33:14,090
Let's go in!

433
00:33:14,770 --> 00:33:15,380
But Shang...

434
00:33:15,570 --> 00:33:16,010
- Brother.
- Hurry up!

435
00:33:20,090 --> 00:33:20,530
Slow down!

436
00:33:25,420 --> 00:33:27,010
Come back here! Get back here!

437
00:34:46,740 --> 00:34:47,050
This is the place.

438
00:34:48,260 --> 00:34:48,820
Thank you so much.

439
00:34:49,300 --> 00:34:50,780
I haven't even asked your name.

440
00:34:52,300 --> 00:34:53,490
I'm Liu Wenji.

441
00:34:53,940 --> 00:34:54,980
Liu Wenji. Thank you!

442
00:34:55,210 --> 00:34:55,780
I'm Chunhua.

443
00:34:57,610 --> 00:34:58,010
Chunhua.

444
00:35:00,650 --> 00:35:01,210
My lady's back!

445
00:35:04,570 --> 00:35:04,900
Oh!

446
00:35:08,490 --> 00:35:08,820
Careful!

447
00:35:42,210 --> 00:35:43,130
My lady!

448
00:35:45,690 --> 00:35:47,420
You're really alive!

449
00:35:48,980 --> 00:35:50,260
I'm not that easy to kill.

450
00:35:52,570 --> 00:35:53,340
You know that.

451
00:36:08,090 --> 00:36:08,570
My lady.

452
00:36:09,490 --> 00:36:10,490
We've only been apart a day,

453
00:36:11,300 --> 00:36:12,980
and you've already made Yan Shang
your male favorite?

454
00:36:13,260 --> 00:36:13,780
Chunhua.

455
00:36:14,090 --> 00:36:15,260
Do I look like that kind of woman?

456
00:36:15,780 --> 00:36:16,170
Yes...

457
00:36:19,650 --> 00:36:20,740
You've misunderstood, Miss Chunhua.

458
00:36:24,380 --> 00:36:25,570
If I were to take a male favorite,

459
00:36:26,210 --> 00:36:27,340
I'd be very particular.

460
00:36:47,050 --> 00:36:47,380
Shang!

461
00:36:48,380 --> 00:36:48,900
Wenji!

462
00:36:49,820 --> 00:36:50,490
What brings you here?

463
00:36:51,170 --> 00:36:51,460
Here!

464
00:36:54,170 --> 00:36:54,610
What's this?

465
00:37:04,620 --> 00:37:07,260
(Awarded First Place in the County's
Qualifying Examination)

466
00:37:13,090 --> 00:37:14,010
You came first!

467
00:37:15,740 --> 00:37:16,380
Wenji!

468
00:37:16,740 --> 00:37:17,690
Just as you predicted,

469
00:37:18,300 --> 00:37:19,610
you passed the local qualifying exam
with ease!

470
00:37:21,980 --> 00:37:22,300
Shang.

471
00:37:23,530 --> 00:37:24,420
Passing the local qualifying exam
is nothing.

472
00:37:25,210 --> 00:37:26,300
Neither is coming first.

473
00:37:26,980 --> 00:37:28,050
When I get to Sheng'an,

474
00:37:28,380 --> 00:37:29,650
I'll pass the imperial examination,

475
00:37:29,940 --> 00:37:30,860
become a marquis and chancellor,

476
00:37:31,170 --> 00:37:32,570
and accomplish something truly great!

477
00:37:35,650 --> 00:37:36,050
Wenji.

478
00:37:36,780 --> 00:37:37,690
I wouldn't say this about anyone else,

479
00:37:38,260 --> 00:37:38,940
but coming from you,

480
00:37:39,490 --> 00:37:40,530
I'm certain you'll achieve it.

481
00:37:42,690 --> 00:37:43,010
Shang.

482
00:37:43,650 --> 00:37:44,090
Rest assured.

483
00:37:44,460 --> 00:37:44,820
In the future,

484
00:37:45,170 --> 00:37:46,050
no matter when or where,

485
00:37:46,420 --> 00:37:47,130
I'll never forget you.

486
00:37:49,900 --> 00:37:50,340
Perhaps

487
00:37:50,690 --> 00:37:51,690
you could serve as my adviser.

488
00:37:52,010 --> 00:37:52,380
Then one day,

489
00:37:52,690 --> 00:37:53,900
we'll accomplish great things together!

490
00:38:07,170 --> 00:38:07,530
Shang.

491
00:38:09,610 --> 00:38:09,900
Come here.

492
00:38:11,170 --> 00:38:12,380
There's something else
I want to ask you.

493
00:38:13,380 --> 00:38:14,050
Earlier,

494
00:38:15,050 --> 00:38:16,610
that young woman was heading here too.

495
00:38:17,210 --> 00:38:17,820
Who is she?

496
00:38:21,610 --> 00:38:23,900
We've had a guest staying
with us these past few days.

497
00:38:24,650 --> 00:38:25,900
She's that guest's maid.

498
00:38:28,690 --> 00:38:29,460
She's a maid?

499
00:38:30,610 --> 00:38:31,090
That's right.

500
00:38:33,860 --> 00:38:34,300
Why?

501
00:38:37,940 --> 00:38:38,210
No...

502
00:38:38,690 --> 00:38:39,090
Nothing.

503
00:38:43,650 --> 00:38:44,260
Liu Wenji!

504
00:38:47,210 --> 00:38:47,900
Miss Chunhua.

505
00:38:50,420 --> 00:38:52,090
Liu Wenji, thanks for your kind words.

506
00:38:52,300 --> 00:38:53,530
My lady really is all right.

507
00:38:55,300 --> 00:38:55,860
What a shame.

508
00:38:56,260 --> 00:38:57,530
All that spirit money went to waste...

509
00:39:04,170 --> 00:39:04,980
What spirit money?

510
00:39:08,130 --> 00:39:09,300
Please don't bring that up.

511
00:39:11,780 --> 00:39:12,260
Liu Wenji.

512
00:39:12,860 --> 00:39:14,340
Just pretend you don't know.

513
00:39:15,340 --> 00:39:15,740
Please?

514
00:39:24,530 --> 00:39:25,860
Anyway, thank you.

515
00:39:29,260 --> 00:39:30,780
I need to fetch some things for my lady.

516
00:39:38,900 --> 00:39:39,260
Wenji.

517
00:39:41,130 --> 00:39:42,010
Why don't you stay for dinner?

518
00:39:43,690 --> 00:39:43,980
No.

519
00:39:44,300 --> 00:39:44,820
You see,

520
00:39:44,980 --> 00:39:47,130
my father's throwing a banquet
at our residence

521
00:39:47,460 --> 00:39:47,940
to celebrate my success.

522
00:39:48,380 --> 00:39:49,090
I'll visit another day.

523
00:39:50,740 --> 00:39:51,010
All right.

524
00:39:52,050 --> 00:39:52,530
I'll see you out.

525
00:40:12,780 --> 00:40:13,340
My lady.

526
00:40:14,170 --> 00:40:16,170
How much longer will you
need to recover?

527
00:40:20,460 --> 00:40:20,980
Chunhua.

528
00:40:21,860 --> 00:40:22,650
Do you like it here?

529
00:40:26,570 --> 00:40:27,530
Lingnan is terribly hot,

530
00:40:27,900 --> 00:40:28,740
and it rains all the time.

531
00:40:29,740 --> 00:40:31,210
The Yan family's house
is pretty run-down too.

532
00:40:31,490 --> 00:40:32,170
And there are bugs everywhere.

533
00:40:34,530 --> 00:40:35,090
But...

534
00:40:35,940 --> 00:40:37,090
the scenery is beautiful.

535
00:40:37,460 --> 00:40:38,380
It's peaceful here too,

536
00:40:38,690 --> 00:40:39,570
with hardly anyone around.

537
00:40:40,340 --> 00:40:42,460
You seem much happier here
than you ever did in the capital.

538
00:40:46,980 --> 00:40:48,210
There's really nothing good
about this place.

539
00:40:49,260 --> 00:40:50,260
My wounds have already healed enough.

540
00:40:51,050 --> 00:40:52,490
Yet I keep putting off leaving,

541
00:40:53,170 --> 00:40:54,490
lingering here day after day.

542
00:40:55,690 --> 00:40:56,690
It's nothing but cowardice.

543
00:40:58,010 --> 00:40:59,210
I'm only fooling myself.

544
00:41:00,300 --> 00:41:01,010
The truth is, I'm afraid,

545
00:41:01,860 --> 00:41:03,300
and I have no desire
to return to Sheng'an.

546
00:41:04,570 --> 00:41:05,050
My lady.

547
00:41:06,260 --> 00:41:07,530
Can't we just stay away?

548
00:41:10,610 --> 00:41:11,340
Do you think hiding here

549
00:41:12,340 --> 00:41:13,260
will keep us safe?

550
00:41:14,690 --> 00:41:15,570
The whole realm

551
00:41:16,460 --> 00:41:17,650
has long since slipped
from the throne's control.

552
00:41:18,780 --> 00:41:19,650
Hiding in Lingnan

553
00:41:20,050 --> 00:41:21,010
or hiding in Sheng'an

554
00:41:21,380 --> 00:41:22,090
makes no difference.

555
00:41:23,900 --> 00:41:24,980
We can hide for a while,

556
00:41:25,490 --> 00:41:26,420
but not forever.

557
00:41:28,490 --> 00:41:29,690
Sooner or later, we must return.

558
00:41:36,820 --> 00:41:37,780
Go fetch Yan Shang.

559
00:41:43,490 --> 00:41:43,940
My lady.

560
00:41:44,610 --> 00:41:45,130
It's late.

561
00:41:45,780 --> 00:41:46,530
Is something the matter?

562
00:41:49,090 --> 00:41:50,340
That day in the cave,

563
00:41:51,260 --> 00:41:52,650
some officers searching
for me passed by.

564
00:41:53,820 --> 00:41:54,940
I know you heard them.

565
00:41:56,300 --> 00:41:57,090
Why didn't you call out?

566
00:42:02,130 --> 00:42:03,010
You were already awake then?

567
00:42:03,210 --> 00:42:03,740
I was.

568
00:42:05,130 --> 00:42:06,900
But I was aching all over.

569
00:42:07,900 --> 00:42:08,740
I didn't feel like speaking

570
00:42:08,980 --> 00:42:09,610
or even moving.

571
00:42:11,300 --> 00:42:12,380
But I didn't expect

572
00:42:13,420 --> 00:42:14,610
you to stay perfectly still either.

573
00:42:21,740 --> 00:42:23,210
Because I didn't want them
to take you away.

574
00:42:24,490 --> 00:42:24,980
Why not?

575
00:42:27,170 --> 00:42:28,050
I'm no gentleman.

576
00:42:29,210 --> 00:42:29,650
There's something

577
00:42:30,610 --> 00:42:31,210
I want from you.

578
00:42:34,130 --> 00:42:35,130
You hid me from them,

579
00:42:35,300 --> 00:42:36,010
saved my life,

580
00:42:36,460 --> 00:42:37,340
brought me home,

581
00:42:37,820 --> 00:42:38,780
and nursed me back to health,

582
00:42:39,300 --> 00:42:40,530
all so I'd feel indebted to you.

583
00:42:41,380 --> 00:42:42,900
You hoped I might give you a chance

584
00:42:43,650 --> 00:42:45,170
to ride on my coattails

585
00:42:46,090 --> 00:42:47,340
and hitch a ride to Sheng'an.

586
00:42:48,900 --> 00:42:50,650
That night, when you argued
with your father,

587
00:42:51,210 --> 00:42:52,130
I heard everything.

588
00:43:01,010 --> 00:43:01,690
That's true.

589
00:43:04,900 --> 00:43:05,340
I'm sorry.

590
00:43:07,570 --> 00:43:08,460
Why apologize?

591
00:43:09,340 --> 00:43:09,780
Yan Shang.

592
00:43:10,490 --> 00:43:11,530
You did save my life.

593
00:43:12,820 --> 00:43:13,740
But my life

594
00:43:16,170 --> 00:43:17,380
isn't worth much to begin with.

595
00:43:25,530 --> 00:43:26,610
You put yourself in danger,

596
00:43:27,340 --> 00:43:28,300
ventured into the woods at night,

597
00:43:28,940 --> 00:43:30,210
and went to all that trouble.

598
00:43:30,820 --> 00:43:31,820
All for nothing.

599
00:43:36,740 --> 00:43:37,530
However,

600
00:43:37,900 --> 00:43:39,300
I'm feeling generous.

601
00:43:40,090 --> 00:43:41,460
I'm willing to give you another chance.

602
00:43:41,820 --> 00:43:43,740
You've served me well these past
few days.

603
00:43:44,210 --> 00:43:44,940
I'm quite pleased.

604
00:43:46,570 --> 00:43:48,610
Before I recover and take my leave,

605
00:43:49,420 --> 00:43:50,010
if you

606
00:43:50,570 --> 00:43:51,610
manage to please me,

607
00:43:52,780 --> 00:43:53,650
then I'll...

608
00:43:58,570 --> 00:43:59,820
I'll take you back with me.

609
00:44:03,500 --> 00:44:07,900
(Next Episode Preview)

610
00:44:08,570 --> 00:44:09,170
(Yan Shang.)

611
00:44:09,300 --> 00:44:10,340
(If you dare repeat)

612
00:44:10,460 --> 00:44:12,050
(a word of what I said today
to anyone else,)

613
00:44:12,210 --> 00:44:13,980
(I'll rip out your tendons
and skin you alive!)

614
00:44:16,210 --> 00:44:17,260
(Greetings, Lord Yu.)

615
00:44:17,860 --> 00:44:18,650
(Greetings, Father.)

616
00:44:19,090 --> 00:44:19,980
(Danyang has returned!)

617
00:44:24,241 --> 00:44:27,534
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

618
00:44:30,219 --> 00:44:35,135
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

619
00:44:37,329 --> 00:44:43,174
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

620
00:44:43,674 --> 00:44:48,900
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

621
00:44:51,669 --> 00:44:56,460
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

622
00:44:57,296 --> 00:45:03,375
♪Through trails of mud and blood;
let grief drown in your eyes♪

623
00:45:05,176 --> 00:45:08,326
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

624
00:45:08,326 --> 00:45:09,974
♪Burning bright as a song♪

625
00:45:10,026 --> 00:45:13,750
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

626
00:45:14,128 --> 00:45:18,794
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

627
00:45:19,413 --> 00:45:23,454
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

628
00:45:23,945 --> 00:45:26,060
♪Not a single hour less♪

629
00:45:26,100 --> 00:45:33,046
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

630
00:45:33,809 --> 00:45:37,262
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

631
00:45:37,442 --> 00:45:40,587
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

632
00:45:41,026 --> 00:45:47,663
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

633
00:45:48,060 --> 00:45:52,574
♪May time be free of fear and pain;
boats rock, lights fade, seasons turn♪

634
00:45:52,612 --> 00:45:55,081
♪You're the only one I need♪

635
00:45:55,285 --> 00:46:02,172
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

636
00:46:02,484 --> 00:46:05,755
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

637
00:46:06,060 --> 00:46:09,233
♪My last untouched innocence♪

638
00:46:09,557 --> 00:46:12,983
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

639
00:46:13,216 --> 00:46:16,441
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

640
00:46:16,772 --> 00:46:23,568
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

641
00:46:23,937 --> 00:46:28,503
♪May time be free of fear and pain;
boats rock, lights fade, seasons turn♪

642
00:46:28,550 --> 00:46:30,888
♪You're the only one I need♪

643
00:46:31,119 --> 00:46:37,954
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

644
00:46:38,303 --> 00:46:39,921
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

645
00:46:40,051 --> 00:46:41,847
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

646
00:46:42,204 --> 00:46:45,221
♪You're the only one I need♪

647
00:46:45,261 --> 00:46:46,588
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)
